#: ../../source/guides/engine/conventions/index.rst:36
msgid "``freeports_dev`` and ``freeports_validate``: layout, docstrings, ruff, the shell half"
msgstr ""
"``freeports_dev`` e ``freeports_validate``: disposição, docstrings, ruff, a metade em"
